:name: ci execution profile
:description: bit-reproducible, 1.0x real time. Rules G1 and G2 of design section 9.2

emulation SetGlobalQuantum "0.002"

# G1. Without serial execution the design measured 14/14 runs diverging in internal state (about
# 0.75% spread in ExecutedInstructions) and observably divergent peripheral traces; with it, 14/14
# matched. tests/e2e/test_determinism.py reproduces that comparison on this host.
emulation SetGlobalSerialExecution true

# G2. Renode's default seed is random per process - three processes produced three values. G2 is an
# independent requirement from G1 and neither substitutes for the other.
emulation SetSeed 20260828

# AdvanceImmediately is deliberately absent. It buys speed and costs bit-reproducibility, and this
# profile exists to spend the speed on the reproducibility.
